alse},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment35:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment35","raw_text":"红如车三平九，则马6进7，帅五进一，车7平2，黑胜势。","text":"红如车三平九，则马6进7，帅五进一，车7平2，黑胜势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":35,"anchor_node_id":"0:35","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":"黑胜。||红如车二平五，则马6进7，帅五进一，车7平2，黑得子亦胜，末后黑平车肋道，形成双杀，一锤定音。","text":"黑胜。\n红如车二平五，则马6进7，帅五进一，车7平2，黑得子亦胜，末后黑平车肋道，形成双杀，一锤定音。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["厦门吴克西 先负 江苏廖二平"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":13,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":40,"legal_move_records":40,"annotations":6,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":6}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第一章 中炮对屏风马类,厦门吴克西 先负 江苏廖二平","catalogue_order":24,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/list-66.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
